      "type": "text",
      "text": "planner.py     rank approved hypotheses\nvalidator.py   interpret evidence vs each cause\nchallenger.py  try to falsify the leader\nrecommendation.py  phrase action + explanation\n\nCalculations come from Decimal functions.\nOutputs validated against typed schemas.\nLLM can be disabled; deterministic fallbacks remain.\nLive trace: agents/trace.py → Streamlit path.",
      "originalText": "planner.py     rank approved hypotheses\nvalidator.py   interpret evidence vs each cause\nchallenger.py  try to falsify the leader\nrecommendation.py  phrase action + explanation\n\nCalculations come from Decimal functions.\nOutputs validated against typed schemas.\nLLM can be disabled; deterministic fallbacks remain.\nLive trace: agents/trace.py → Streamlit path.",
