      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Exception table + live agent path\nERP / gateway / bank amounts\nRanked hypotheses + source-backed facts\nChallenge checks + rejected alternatives\nRecommended action + human interrupt\n\nDemo cases the product must show:\n1. Easy win — gateway fee, auto-resolve\n2. Refund — evidence explains shortfall\n3. Hard case — abstain, human review\n\nMemory: data/historical_cases.db + state.db",
      "originalText": "Exception table + live agent path\nERP / gateway / bank amounts\nRanked hypotheses + source-backed facts\nChallenge checks + rejected alternatives\nRecommended action + human interrupt\n\nDemo cases the product must show:\n1. Easy win — gateway fee, auto-resolve\n2. Refund — evidence explains shortfall\n3. Hard case — abstain, human review\n\nMemory: data/historical_cases.db + state.db",
